PN,40501
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FThe daughter of convicted murderer
OL,8,FGlyn Razzell has urged the High Court
OL,9,Fto 'reverse' the Parole Board's
OL,10,Fdecision to release her father.
OL,12,FGlynn Razzell, who is originally from
OL,13,FCrewekerne, Somerset, was jailed for
OL,14,Flife with a minimum of almost 16 years
OL,15,Fin 2003 for murdering his estranged
OL,16,Fwife, Linda Razzell, whose body has
OL,17,Fnever been found.
OL,19,FThe mother-of-four disappeared on her
OL,20,Fway to work at Swindon College, in
OL,21,FMarch 2002, amid divorce proceedings.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FThe Parole Board ruled three times
OL,8,Ffrom 2019 that Razzell, who continues
OL,9,Fto plead his innocence, should remain
OL,10,Fbehind bars, but in April decided he
OL,11,Fcould be released on licence.
OL,13,FThe Ministry of Justice has referred
OL,14,Fthe decision to the High Court,
OL,15,Ftelling a two-day hearing that it
OL,16,Fshould be reversed because the Parole
OL,17,FBoard failed to consider Razzell's
OL,18,Frisk properly.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FRazzell, who attended both days of the
OL,8,Fhearing and was pictured in public for
OL,9,Fthe first time in more than 20 years
OL,10,Fduring the proceedings, is opposing
OL,11,Fthe bid to challenge his release.
OL,13,FThe Parole Board's decision came after
OL,14,Fconsideration of Helen's Law, named
OL,15,Fafter Helen McCourt, who vanished on
OL,16,Fher way home from work in 1988.
OL,18,FThe law requires the Parole Board to
OL,19,Ftake into consideration a killer's
OL,20,Frefusal to disclose where they hid
OL,21,Ftheir victim's body.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FRazzell's daughter, Catherine said:
OL,8,F"My father committed murder. The
OL,9,FParole Board believe he committed
OL,10,Fcoercive control. He denies guilt and
OL,11,Fwill not tell us where our mother is.
OL,13,F"He has done nothing to address this.
OL,14,FHe is therefore a danger and women
OL,15,Fhave good reason to feel less safe if
OL,16,Fhe is released. We are not here to ask
OL,17,Ffor the impossible.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,F"We are asking for a decision that
OL,8,Ftakes seriously the ongoing harm to
OL,9,Fthis family and the potential risk to
OL,10,Fothers."
OL,12,FAt the start of the hearing on Tuesday
OL,13,F11 August, Mrs Razzell's partner Greg
OL,14,FWorrall appeared via video link and
OL,15,Ftold the court that Razzell was
OL,16,Fexerting "coercive control over people
OL,17,Feven in death".
OL,19,FMr Worrall told the court: "We have
OL,20,Frebuilt our lives based on the fact he
OL,21,Fcannot harm us any more."
OL,26,@xD@JOUyD@NO]{D@\OU}D@YO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FHe said that Mrs Razzell's family had
OL,8,F"picked up the pieces of our shattered
OL,9,Flives" with the support of friends and
OL,10,Ffamily.
OL,12,F"We have found love and purpose in our
OL,13,Fnew lives," he said, adding that there
OL,14,Fis a 'sadness which will always be
OL,15,Fthere' after his partner's murder,
OL,16,Fespecially on holidays and
OL,17,Fanniversaries.
OL,26,@pD@AOUqD@FO]tD@AOUuD@KO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FHe said that during Razzell's multiple
OL,8,Fparole applications, he could 'show
OL,9,Fremorse' and disclose where Mrs
OL,10,FRazzell's remains were.
OL,12,FMr Worrall later said: "He knows the
OL,13,Fpain this is causing Linda's family
OL,14,Fand children."
OL,16,F"We need an end to this ongoing
OL,17,Fagony," he added.
OL,19,FMr Worrall said: "We were assured he
OL,20,Fwould never be released if he did not
OL,21,Freveal Linda's whereabouts."
OL,26,@tD@XOUvD@NO]xD@AOUyD@GO]{D@ROU}D@\O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FHe continued that he felt Razzell was
OL,8,Fstill a danger to women and was
OL,9,Fcommitting the crime of preventing a
OL,10,Flawful burial.
OL,12,FHe added: "Am I safe? Are my family
OL,13,Fsafe? Are the wider community safe?"
OL,15,FIn its April decision, a Parole Board
OL,16,Fpanel said that it had 'serious
OL,17,Fdoubts' about Razzell's honesty and
OL,18,Fthat there was a 'very significant'
OL,19,Frisk in the context of relationships,
OL,20,Fbut said this was 'not imminent'.
OL,26,@tD@KOUuD@dO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FIt decided that he would comply with
OL,8,Flicence conditions as he was 'strongly
OL,9,Fmotivated not to return to custody'.
OL,11,FThe MoJ can refer a Parole Board's
OL,12,Fdecision to release a prisoner to the
OL,13,FHigh Court if it believes the release
OL,14,Fwould undermine public confidence in
OL,15,Fthe parole system, and the court must
OL,16,Fbe satisfied that imprisonment is no
OL,17,Flonger necessary for the protection of
OL,18,Fthe public.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FMatthew Stanbury, for Razzell, told
OL,8,Fthe court that there should not be
OL,9,F'undue focus on one particular course
OL,10,Fwhich is seen as a silver bullet in
OL,11,Ffixing risk'.
OL,13,FHe also said that psychologists had
OL,14,Fpaid 'close attention' to Razzell's
OL,15,Fcase and that a psychologist had spent
OL,16,F17 hours with him, as opposed to an
OL,17,Faverage of about six with other
OL,18,Fprisoners.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FMr Stanbury said this gave
OL,8,Fprofessionals a 'much deeper
OL,9,Funderstanding of Mr Razzell'.
OL,11,FThe barrister said in written
OL,12,Fsubmissions that the Parole Board's
OL,13,Fdecision was 'detailed and thorough',
OL,14,Fand that the MoJ's case 'comes close
OL,15,Fto treating denial as conclusive to
OL,16,Frisk'.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,FHe said: "The claimant's case is
OL,8,Fpredicated on wrong assumptions or
OL,9,Fassertions that the defendant's denial
OL,10,Fof his offending, and attendant non-
OL,11,Fcompletion of offending behaviour
OL,12,Fprogrammes, are a bar to release.
OL,14,F"Both factors were properly considered
OL,15,Fand weighed by an experienced Parole
OL,16,FBoard panel which considered the
OL,17,Fcountervailing factors and matters in
OL,18,Fthe round.
OL,26,@oD@JOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786555124
OL,3,CConvicted murderer's daughter pleads
OL,4,Cwith High Court to reverse father's
OL,5,Crelease
OL,7,F"There is no, or no sufficiently
OL,8,Fcogent, basis for departing from the
OL,9,Fpanel's decision."
OL,11,FAt the end of the hearing, judge Mrs
OL,12,FJustice Cheema-Grubb said that she
OL,13,Fwould give her decision "in a matter
OL,14,Fof weeks".
OL,16,FShe later said: "I hope there is some
OL,17,Fmovement in the defendant's mind",
OL,18,Fadding: "It is in his hands to do so."
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@RO]uD@YOUvD@IO]xD@QOUyD@aO]zD@
OL,26,AIOUzD@fO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/13
